Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||07-15-2001||04:52 PM||||Does anyone have factory Fiero seats that have headrest speaker holes, without speakers inside?<P>I picked up a grey passenger side seat in great condition from out of a wrecked Fiero that has headrest speaker holes with no speakers inside... <P>I may use this seat to recover with a Mr. Mike's kit, however, if it's a factory anomaly, I'll keep it as-is...||||reg||5
